/*--------------------------------*- Choupo -*-------------------------------*\
  envelope01_natural_gas -- the P-T phase envelope of a lean natural gas.

  WHAT IT DEMONSTRATES, and the second half is the point:

    * the DEW branch traced in pressure, over the cricondentherm -- marching
      P, the temperature maximum is not a turning point for the
      specification, so the trace walks straight over it and the maximum is
      visible in the data;

    * the BUBBLE branch STARTING LATE, announced as what it is.  This feed
      is 80 % methane and below about 45 bar its bubble line lies under the
      saturation solver's own 200 K bracket: the 30 pressures from 1 to
      44.9 bar produce no point, every one of them tried and listed, and the
      branch first converges at 46.385 bar (200.119 K) and keeps 10 points
      to 60 bar.  Until EX-01 (2026-11-15) the op ended a branch at its first
      failed pressure and reported this one as "never started"; a branch
      now "never started" only when no pressure in the range converged (the
      gate check_phase_envelope probes the same feed on 1-40 bar for that).
      A late start, a stop at a turning point and a branch that never
      started are reported differently because the remedies differ.

  NOT CLAIMED: the nose.  A pressure-marched trace cannot pass the
  cricondenbar, nor the critical point where the branches merge.  Closing it
  needs arc-length continuation with a switching specification (Michelsen,
  Fluid Phase Equilib. 4 (1980) 1) and that is not implemented.

  NOT VALIDATED: no number here is checked against a measured envelope.  The
  feed is a plausible lean gas, not a sampled one, and the K-values come from
  Peng-Robinson over an ideal liquid.  This is a STRUCTURAL witness -- it
  shows what the op reports and refuses to report, not that the curve is
  right.
\*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

application   choupoProps;
description   "P-T phase envelope of a lean natural gas: the dew branch over its cricondentherm, and a bubble branch that starts late (46 bar), every lower pressure tried and listed";
verbosity     3;
